      "en": "I made myself gardens and parks, and I planted trees in them of all kinds of fruit.",
      "ko": "여러 동산과 과원을 만들고 그 가운데 각종 과목을 심었으며",
      "source_text_hash": "1b70e8d64869f315749654fe9be6f49f2435aa48f2d08265d3999cf89b88f4ec",
      "translation_text_hash": "6c256a9f40521a865111fbd191e0c3189bd997b6eb23ce2bb9826184f454113c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
