      "en": "Then I saw that wisdom excels folly, as far as light excels darkness.",
      "ko": "내가 보건대 지혜가 우매보다 뛰어남이 빛이 어두움보다 뛰어남 같도다",
      "source_text_hash": "6e30ba5fb20dc0043de54c466b1f0108468aaac2376b1188a2ae8348ef0d3f06",
      "translation_text_hash": "c4a0e8e2af05fe9a979d4bed2018328aad9e35331dadab148c3b80b28bd7b99a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 보건대 지혜가 우매보다 뛰어남이 빛이 어두움보다 뛰어남 같도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c4a0e8e2af05fe9a979d4bed2018328aad9e35331dadab148c3b80b28bd7b99a"
